OL,3,AGerman Chancellor Merz vows to stay on
OL,4,Adespite 'disaster' in state election
OL,5,
OL,6,FMerz is under mounting pressure, with
OL,7,Fpoor approval ratings and rumours he
OL,8,Fcould even be replaced mid-term in a
OL,9,Fso-called chancellor swap.
